From 7ce30dc31c22f11f96798d86118df11262a90b95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: warelik <warelik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:28:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] Add compact layout settings, Mono Light theme and halved
 threads sidebar width

Opt-in density settings, all defaulting to stock Zed:
agent.threads_sidebar.compact, shadows.project_panel, shadows.minimap,
toolbar.compact and panel_rows_tab_height. A compact toolbar hides the
dismissed Python banner before any later mode change.

Without any setting this also halves the threads sidebar minimum width
(200 to 100 px), reserves one em instead of two after the text in
single-line editors and bundles the Mono Light theme (not selected by
default).

